#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&klettres; is a very simple application that helps a child or an adult to "
"learn the alphabet and some simple sounds in his own language or in another "
"language. The program picks up a letter or a syllable in random, this letter/"
"syllable is displayed and the sound is played. The user should then type "
"this letter or syllable. Training is done in the levels where the letter/"
"syllable is not displayed, only the sound is played. The user does not need "
"to know how to use the mouse, the keyboard only is needed."
msgstr ""
"&klettres; je veoma jednostavna aplikacija koja pomaže djetetu ili odraslom "
"da nauči alfabet ili jednostavne zvukuve u svom jeziku ili nekom drugom. "
"Promgram bira slova ili slogane redom, ovo slovo/slogan je na displeju i "
"zvuk je pušten. Korisnik treba da iskuca ovo slovo ili slogan. Trening je "
"završen na levelima gdje slovo/slogan nisu prikazani više, samo imamo zvuk. "
"Korisnik ne mora znati kako koristiti miša, samo je tastatura potrebna."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are twenty five languages available at the moment: see the list above. "
"If your &kde; language is among those, then it is taken as default, "
"otherwise French is the default. You can easily get any additional available "
"language by using the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu and <guimenuitem>Get "
"Alphabet in New Language...</guimenuitem> menu item, provided that your "
"computer is connected to the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno je dostupno dvadesterpet jezika: pogledajte listu iznad. Ako se "
"&kde; jezik nalazi na listi, onda je prikazan kaom default, u drugom slučaju "
"je Francuski. Možete lakho dobiti dodatni jezik koristeći <guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu> izbornik i  <guimenuitem> Alfabet na Novoj Jeziku ...</guimenuitem> "
"izbornik, dokazuje da li je vaš računar konektovan na Internet."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Two different modes allow you to adapt &klettres; to your need and have the "
"full usual interface or a stripped interface. For a child, the menubar is no "
"longer visible. We assume that a child will not want to set the language "
"himself. A combo box allows him to choose the different levels. For an older "
"user, the background is not so childish and the menubar is present in the "
"Grown-Up style. Three different themes (<guimenuitem>Kid</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Desert</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Savannah</guimenuitem>) "
"set up a different background with different fonts and colors."
msgstr ""
"Dva različita načina vam dozvoljavaju adaptaciju &klettres; za vaše potrebe "
"potpunu upotrebu. Za dijete, izbornik više nije vidljiv. Predpostavljamo da "
"dijete neće postavljati jezik samo za sebe. Promjenjiva kutija dozvoljava mu "
"da bira levele. Za starijeg korisnika, pozadina nije tako djetinjasta i "
"Izbornika je predstavljen u formi za Odrasle. Tri različite teme "
"(<guimenuitem>Dijete</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Pustinja</guimenuitem> i "
"<guimenuitem>Savannah</guimenuitem>)  postavite različite pozadine sa "
"različitim veličinama i bojama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You do not need the language keyboard layout anymore as you can use the "
"special <guimenuitem>Special Characters</guimenuitem> toolbar to type any "
"special character in each language. In the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, "
"<guisubmenu>Toolbars Shown</guisubmenu>, select <guimenuitem>Special "
"Characters</guimenuitem> and the toolbar will appear at the bottom of "
"&klettres;. Click on the letter you want and it will be shown in the input "
"field. This toolbar can be dragged anywhere on your screen."
msgstr ""
"Ne trebate jezičku tastaturu više od korištenja obične <guimenuitem> "
"Specijalni Znakovi </guimenuitem> alatnu traku da iskucate specijalne "
"znakove u svakom jeziku. U <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> izbornik, "
"<guisubmenu>Alatna traka prikazuje </guisubmenu>, selektuj "
"<guimenuitem>Specijalni Znakovi</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you prefer having the language keyboard layout, please use "
"&systemsettings;, in the category <guilabel>Hardware</guilabel>, "
"<guimenu>Input Devices</guimenu> on the page <guimenuitem>Keyboard</"
"guimenuitem> in order to set the correct keyboard layout."
msgstr ""
"Ako preferirate specjalnu upotrebu tastature, koristite  &systemsettings; u "
"kategoriji <guilabel>Hardware</guilabel>, <guimenu>Priključenji Uređaji </"
"guimenu> na stranici <guimenuitem>Tastatura </guimenuitem> da bi namjestili "
"specijalnu upotrebu tastature."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &klettres;"
msgstr "Korištenje &klettres;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&klettres; has 4 levels. Levels 1 and 2 deal with the alphabet and levels 3 "
"and 4 concern syllables. For a very young child (2 1/2 to 4), I would "
"suggest that he/she is sitting on your lap in front of the computer and that "
"you do the game together."
msgstr ""
"&klettres; ima 4 levela. Level 1 i 2 se bave alfabetom i leveli 3 i 4 sa "
"bave sloganima. Za veoma mlado dijete  (2 1/2 to 4), preporučili bi da on/"
"ona sjede u vašem krilu ispred računara i da igrate igru zajedno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Levels 1 and 2"
msgstr "Level 1 i 2"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of &klettres; Level 1"
msgstr "Slika ekrana za &klettres; Level 1"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres; level1"
msgstr "&klettres; level 1"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Level is Level 1, language is French, theme is Desert and mode is "
"<emphasis>grown-up</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Level je Level 1, jezik je Francuski, tema je Pustinja i način je "
"<emphasis>odrasli</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your &kde; language is among the supported languages then this will be "
"the default language the first time you run &klettres;. For other languages, "
"English is the default. &klettres; comes with English, French and your "
"default language if among those listed above and you can get additional "
"languages via <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Get Alphabet "
"in New Language...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> provided you have an Internet "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Ako je vaš  &kde;  jezik među podržanim jezicima onda će biti to default "
"jezik kad počnete prvi put &klettres;. Za druge jezike, Engleski je početni. "
"&klettres;  dolazi sa Engleskim, Francuskim i vašim jezikom kao početnim, "
"dodatne jezike možete dobiti putem  <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Alfabet na Novom Jeziku...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> putem "
"Internet konekcije na vaše, računaru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In level 1, the user sees the letter and hears the sound. He then has to "
"type in the letter in the box. If it is correct, the next letter appears "
"(without having to press &Enter; or whatever). If the user types the wrong "
"letter, he hears the sound again. In this level, the user memorizes the "
"letters, associates them with their sound and recognizes them on the "
"keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Na levelu 1, korisnik vidi pismo i čuje zvuk. Nakon tog treba da piše slova "
"u prozor. Ako je ispravno, slijedeća slova će se pojaviti (bez pritiskanja "
"&Enter; ili nečeg drugog). Ako korisnik istipka pogrešna slova, on čuje zvuk "
"ponovo. Na ovom levelu, korisnik pamti slova, povezuje ih sa zvukom i "
"prepoznaje ih na tastaturi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The user can type in either lower or uppercase letters. The letters are "
"automatically put in uppercase so that a child will match them with the "
"keyboard. He can type only one letter at atime."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik može pisati ili malim ili velikim slovima. Slova su automatski "
"namještena kao velika tako da ih dijete može uporediti s tastarurom. Ono "
"može da tipka samo jedno po jedno slovo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you type a letter in the input field, there is no need to press &Enter; "
"and the program waits for a short while before testing if the letter is "
"right. This short wait is to leave time to a young child to understand what "
"he/she just typed, especially if this is the wrong letter. You can change "
"this time by using the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &klettres;...</guimenuitem> and the <guilabel>Timer</"
"guilabel> page which will bring you a dialog where you can set two different "
"times: one for the <guilabel>Kid Mode</guilabel> and one for the "
"<guilabel>Grown-up Mode</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Kada upišete slovo u polje za unos, nema potrebe da pritiščete  &Enter; "
"program će sam nakon kraćeg vremenskog perioda provjeriti da li je slovo "
"ispravno. Ovaj kratki vremenski period će ostaviti dijetetu vremena da "
"razumije šta on/ona su iskucali, posebno ako je slovo ne tačno. Možete "
"promijeniti trajanje ovog vremena koristeći  <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"izbornik, <guimenuitem>Kofiguracije &klettres;...</guimenuitem> i "
"<guilabel>Timer</guilabel>koja će vas dovesti do dijaloga gdje možete "
"postaviti dva različita vremena : jedan za <guilabel>Dječiji Način</"
"guilabel> i jedan za  <guilabel>Odrasli Način</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the first time, the language setting is saved in a configuration file "
"on closing of &klettres; and loaded the next time, with the level you were "
"in."
msgstr ""
"Poslije prvog puta, jezik je sačuvan u konfiguracijskom fajlu zatvaranja "
"&klettres; i pokrenut će biti slijedećeg puta, na onom levelu na kojem je "
"već."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mode (kid or grown-up) is saved in the config file and therefore is kept "
"until you change."
msgstr ""
"Režim rada (dijete ili odrarasli) je sačuvan u konfiguracijskom fajlu i zato "
"je sačuvano dok vi ne promijenite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The letters appear in random order. They are not the same consecutively."
msgstr "Slova će se pojaviti u redu. Nisu ista svaki put."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of &klettres; Level 2"
msgstr "Slika ekrana  &klettres; Level 2"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres; level2"
msgstr "&klettres; level2"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a screenshot of Level 2 with the <emphasis>kid</emphasis> mode, "
"<emphasis>Kid</emphasis> theme and Danish language."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je slika za Level 2 sa <emphasis>dijete</emphasis> način, "
"<emphasis>Dijete</emphasis> tema i Danski jezik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking in the <guilabel>Level</guilabel> combo-box and choosing "
"<guilabel>Level 2</guilabel> or using the <guimenu>Level</guimenu> menu "
"brings you to level 2. In that level, the user only hears the sound of the "
"letter and has to type in the letter. If he is wrong, the letter appears to "
"help him."
msgstr ""
"Klikanjem na  <guilabel>Level</guilabel> promjenjiva-kutija i biranje "
"<guilabel>Level 2</guilabel>ili koristeći <guimenu>Level</guimenu>izbornika "
"vas dovodi do levela 2."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "Levels 3 and 4"
msgstr "Nivoi 3 i 4"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of &klettres; Level 3"
msgstr "Slika ekrana  &klettres; Level 3"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres; level3"
msgstr "&klettres; level3"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can see &klettres; level 3, <emphasis>grown-up</emphasis> mode, "
"<emphasis>Savannah</emphasis> theme and Czech language."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete vidjeti &klettres; level 3, <emphasis>odrasli</emphasis> način, "
"<emphasis>Savannah</emphasis> tema i češki jezik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In level 3, the user sees the syllable and hears the sound. He then has to "
"type in the letters in the box. If the first letter of the sound is wrong, "
"the user cannot type in the second one. The letter disappears and he has to "
"try again. The number of letters is two or three, it depends of the language."
msgstr ""
"Na levelu 3, korisnik vidi slogane i čuje zvuk. Ona otkuca slova u prozor. "
"Ako je prvo slovo zvuka pogrešno, korisnik ne može upisati drugo. Slovo "
"nestaje i on mora pokušati ponovo. Broj slova je dva ili tri, zavisi od "
"jezika."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of &klettres; Level 4"
msgstr "Slika ekrana of &klettres; Level 4"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres; level4"
msgstr "&klettres; level4"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can see &klettres; level 4, <emphasis>kid</emphasis> mode, "
"<emphasis>Desert</emphasis> theme and Slovak language."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete vidjeti &klettres; level 4, <emphasis>Dijete</emphasis> način, "
"<emphasis>Pustinja</emphasis> tema i Slovački jezik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "The sounds appear in random order."
msgstr "Zvuk se pojavljuje slučajnim redoslijedom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking in the <guilabel>Level</guilabel> combo-box or using the "
"<guimenu>Level</guimenu> menu in the menubar and choosing <guilabel>Level 4</"
"guilabel> brings you to level 4. In that level, the user only hears the "
"sound of the syllable and has to type in the letters. This level is quite "
"difficult for a young child."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na  <guilabel>Level</guilabel> combo-box ili koristeći "
"<guimenu>Level </guimenu> izbornik u glavnom izborniiku i izabiranje "
"<guilabel>Level 4</guilabel> dovodi vas do levela 4. U tom levelu, korisnik "
"čuje samo zvuk slogana i mora da istipka slova. Ovaj level je poprilično "
"težak za malu dijecu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration dialog"
msgstr "Konfiguracijski dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The configuration dialog has two pages: one for <guilabel>Font Settings</"
"guilabel> and one for the <guilabel>Timer</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracijski dijalog ima dvije stranice: jednu za <guilabel>Postavke "
"Veličine </guilabel> i jednu za  <guilabel>Timer </guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid "About fonts"
msgstr "O fontovima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can easily change the font that displays the letters. In some "
"distribution, the default font used from the system is really ugly. In grown-"
"up mode, in the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, in <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&klettres;...</guimenuitem> you will find a <guilabel>Font Settings</"
"guilabel> page with a font chooser dialog. The new font will be applied to "
"both the displayed letter/syllable and the user field."
msgstr ""
"Možete lakho promijeniti font koji prikazuje slova. U nekim distribucijama, "
"default fontovi korišteni sa sistema su zaista ružni. U odraslom načinu "
"rada, u <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> izbornik, u  <guimenuitem>Konfiguracija "
"&klettres;...</guimenuitem> pronaći ćete  <guilabel>Font Postavke</guilabel> "
"stranica sa izbornikom fontova. Novi font će biti primjenjen na oba pisma/"
"slogana u korisnićkom polju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing font is also nice as some fonts (Helvetica for example) do not "
"display correctly East-European languages as Czech and Slovak. If some "
"letters or syllables are not displayed, please change the font and choose "
"Arial for example."
msgstr ""
"Promjena fontova je također lijepa  (Helvetica naprimjer) ne prikazuje tačno "
"Istočno-Evropske jezike kao što su Češki i Slovački. Ako neka slova ili "
"slogani nisu prikazani, promijenite font i koristite Arial naprimjer."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also choose here the size you like the best. This size will be kept "
"in configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje također možete izabrati veličinu koja vam najviše odgovara. Ova "
"veličina će biti sačuvana u konfiguraciji."

#. Tag: screeninfo
