#, no-c-format
msgid "&klettres; Font Chooser Dialog"
msgstr "&klettres; Dijalog Izabira Fonta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can see &klettres; Font Chooser Dialog."
msgstr "Ovdje možete vidjeti &klettres; Dijalog Izabira Fonta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "Timers"
msgstr "Tajmeri"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The timers set the time between two letters &ie; the time during which a "
"letter is displayed. The units are tenths of seconds."
msgstr ""
"Timeri su postavljeni između dva pisma  &ie;  vrijeme dok je pismo "
"postavljeno. Jedinica je desetina sekunde."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Timer</guilabel> page in the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &klettres;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"dialog has two timers settings: one for the <guilabel>Kid Mode</guilabel> "
"and one for the <guilabel>Grown-up Mode</guilabel>. Defaults are 4 tenths of "
"seconds for <guilabel>Kid Mode</guilabel> and 2 tenths of seconds for "
"<guilabel>Grown-up Mode</guilabel>. Increasing the time leaves you more time "
"to see your errors."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Timer</guilabel>stranica u <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Konfiguracije &klettres;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dijalog "
"ima dva timera postavke: jedan za  <guilabel>>Diječiji Način</guilabel> i u  "
"<guilabel>Odrasli Način</guilabel>. Defaults su 4/10 sekundi za "
"<guilabel>Dječiji Način</guilabel> i 2/10 sekundi za  <guilabel>Odrasli "
"Način</guilabel>. Povečavanje vremena vam ostavlja više prostora da uvidite "
"svoje greške."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of &klettres; Timers Settings</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> Slike ekrana za &klettres; Postavke Timera </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of &klettres; Timers Settings</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> Slike ekrana za &klettres; Postavke Timera</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting a new language"
msgstr "Postavljanje novog jezika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might want to use &klettres; to help you learn a new language. By using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Get Alphabet in New "
"Language...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, you will see a new dialog with the "
"list of available languages (you need to be connected to the Internet to use "
"that feature)."
msgstr ""
"Možda će te morati koristiti &klettres; da bi vam pomogao da naučite novi "
"jezik. Koristeći <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl </guimenu> <guimenuitem> Alfabet "
"Novog Jezika...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, vidjet ćete novi dijalog sa "
"listom dostupnih jezika (morate biti konektovani na Internet da bi koristili "
"ova svojstva)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Get a New Language Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Novi Jezički Dijalog</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Get a New Language Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Novi Jezički Dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guilabel>Install</guilabel> button on the right of the "
"language you want to install."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na <guilabel>Instaliraj</guilabel> dugme na desnoj strani za jezik "
"koji želite instaliratu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that some files have several MB so it might be slow depending on "
"your connection."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da neki fajlovi imaju nekoliko MB tako da  može biti sporo "
"ovisno o vašoj konekciji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the file is downloaded, it is automatically installed and when you "
"close the <guilabel>Get Hot New Stuff</guilabel> dialog you'll see the new "
"language in the <guimenu>Language</guimenu> menu and you can use it "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je fajl preuzet, automatski je instaliran i kad zatvorite "
"<guilabel>Preuzmite Nove Super Stvari</guilabel>dijalog koji ćete vidjeti "
"novi jezik je u njemu <guimenu>Jezik</guimenu> izbornik i možete ga "
"koristiti automatski."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a language is downloaded, you then can see the <guilabel>Install</"
"guilabel> button turning to <guilabel>Uninstall</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Kada je jezik preuzet, onda vidite  <guilabel>Instaliraj</guilabel>dugme "
"namijenjeno za  <guilabel>Deinstaliraj</guilabel>."

