#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Sounds to &klettres;"
msgstr "Dodavanje Zvukova u &klettres;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you would like to add sounds in your own language, it is very easy to do "
"so. Record the alphabet sounds and place them in a folder named 'alpha'. "
"Then record the most current syllables and put them in a folder named "
"'syllab'."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da dodate zvuk na svom jeziku, to je veoma lahko uraditi. Snimite "
"zvučni alfabet i stavite ga u folder pod imenom \"alpha\". Onda snimite "
"najuobičajnije slogane i stavite ih u folder pod imenom \"slogani\"."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create a text file <filename>sounds.xml</filename>, preferably using &kate; "
"as editor or another editor capable of different encoding. In this file, "
"write all the alphabet sounds and syllable sounds you recorded, like this "
"example for the czech language:"
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte pisani tekst  <filename>sounds.xml</filename>, po mogučnosti "
"koristeći &kate; kao urednika ili neki drugi editor sa sposobnošću "
"različitih kodiranja. U ovom fajlu, snimite sve zvučne alfabete i slogane, "
"kao ovaj primjera za češki jezik:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:547
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&lt;klettres&gt;\n"
"&lt;language code=\"cs\"&gt;\n"
"    &lt;menuitem&gt;\n"
"      &lt;label&gt;&amp;Czech&lt;/label&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/menuitem&gt;\n"
"    &lt;alphabet&gt;\n"
"        &lt;sound name=\"A\" file=\"cs/alpha/a.ogg\" /&gt;\n"
"        ...\n"
"    &lt;/alphabet&gt;\n"
"    &lt;syllables&gt;\n"
"        &lt;sound name=\"BA\" file=\"cs/syllab/ba.ogg\" /&gt;\n"
"        ...\n"
"    &lt;/syllables&gt;\n"
"  &lt;/language&gt;\n"
"&lt;/klettres&gt;"
msgstr ""
"&lt;klettres&gt;\n"
"&lt;language code=\"cs\"&gt;\n"
"    &lt;menuitem&gt;\n"
"      &lt;label&gt;&amp;Czech&lt;/label&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/menuitem&gt;\n"
"    &lt;alphabet&gt;\n"
"        &lt;sound name=\"A\" file=\"cs/alpha/a.ogg\" /&gt;\n"
"        ...\n"
"    &lt;/alphabet&gt;\n"
"    &lt;syllables&gt;\n"
"        &lt;sound name=\"BA\" file=\"cs/syllab/ba.ogg\" /&gt;\n"
"        ...\n"
"    &lt;/syllables&gt;\n"
"  &lt;/language&gt;\n"
"&lt;/klettres&gt;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace \"cs\" with the two letter code and \"Czech\" with the name of your "
"language. Write the sound names with the special characters of your language "
"in uppercase in utf8."
msgstr ""
"Zamijenite \"cs\"sa dvoslovnim kodom i \"Czech\" sa imenom vašeg jezika. "
"Napišite imena zvukova sa specijalnim znakovima vašeg jezika velikim slovima "
"u utf8."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally you can tell me about special letters in your language so I can "
"easily generate the special <guimenuitem>Special Characters</guimenuitem> "
"toolbar. Create a text file <filename>cs.txt</filename> (replace \"cs\" with "
"the two letter code of your language) with each special character of your "
"language in uppercase on one line. And save both text files with "
"<quote>utf8</quote> encoding (upper right dropbox in &kate; allows that)"
msgstr ""
"Dodatno možete mi reći o specijalnim slovima u vašem jeziku tako da mogu "
"lako da generišem <guimenuitem>Specijalne Oznake</guimenuitem>alatna traka. "
"Kreirajte tekst falj <filename>bs.txt</filename> (bs je kod našeg jezika) sa "
"specijalnim slovima vašeg jezika napisanim velikim slovima u jednoj liniji. "
"I snimite obije tekst datoteke <quote>utf8</quote> kodiranje (gornja desna "
"padajuća lista u &kate; to omogućuje)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The sounds should be in ogg format and long enough for the audio player to "
"play them (between 1.5 and 2 seconds long, please add some silence if they "
"are too short). Then make a tarball of all that and send it to me."
msgstr ""
"Zvuk treba da bude u ogg formatu i dovoljno dug za audio da bi mogao da ja "
"pusti ( između 1.5 i 2 sekunde dug, molimo vas dodajte neke pauze ako je "
"audio prekratakt). Poslije tog napravite arhivu tog o pošaljite meni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See the <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/klettres/add_language.php"
"\">&klettres; website</ulink> for more up to date instructions on how to add "
"a new language."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/klettres/add_language.php"
"\">&klettres; website</ulink>za novije instrukcije morate dodati novi jezik."

