msgstr ""
"Ako gradite &klettres;sebe, trebate uraditi konfiguraciju sa  <option>--"
"prefix</option> opcije spremljene u vaš &kde; folder ili da dodate ovaj "
"folder na vaš put."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:579
#, no-c-format
msgid "I do not hear any sounds"
msgstr "Ne čujem nikakva zvuk."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:582
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure that &phonon; is working on your system. To do so, open "
"&systemsettings; and in the <guilabel>Hardware</guilabel> category click on "
"<guilabel>Multimedia</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Potrudite se da &phonon; radi na vašem sistemu. Da bi bilo tako, otvoriten  "
"&systemsettings; i u  <guilabel>Hardware</guilabel> kategorije kliknite na "
"<guilabel>Multimedia</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I do not see some letters on the icons on the special "
"<guimenuitem>Characters</guimenuitem> toolbar. I see rectangles instead for "
"some languages."
msgstr ""
"Ne vidim neka slova na ikonama na specijalnim <guimenuitem>Znakovima</"
"guimenuitem> alatne trake.Vidim pravougaonike umjesto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:591 index.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&klettres; in Czech and Slovak needs Arial and if you do not have this font "
"installed, please ask your distribution support how to install it."
msgstr ""
"&klettres; na Češkom i Slovačkom potreban vam je Arial i ako nemate ovaj "
"font instaliran, molimo pitajte svog distributera da vam pokaže kako "
"instalirati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:592 index.docbook:603
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have &Windows; on your machine, you can use the TTF fonts from "
"&Windows; (Arial is in those) via &systemsettings; -&gt; <guilabel>System "
"Administration</guilabel> -&gt; <guilabel>Font Installer</guilabel> and add "
"the &Windows; Font folder."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate &Windows; na vašoj mašini, možete koristiti TTF fontove sa  "
"&Windows; (Arial je u onim ) via &systemsettings; -&gt; <guilabel>System "
"Administracija</guilabel> -&gt; <guilabel>Font Instalacija</guilabel>i "
"dodajte na  &Windows; Font folder."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The letters on the icons on the <guimenuitem>Special Characters</"
"guimenuitem> toolbar are too small for some languages."
msgstr ""
"Slova na ikonama na <guimenuitem>Speciajalno Znakovi</guimenuitem> alatna "
"traka je premala za neke jezike."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why are there only twenty five languages?"
msgstr "Zašto je samo dvadesetpet jezika?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:613
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order for me to add a new language, I need the sounds for the alphabet "
"and some basic syllables. Someone speaking natively the new language must "
"record these sounds in ogg format. For levels 3 and 4, the syllables must be "
"chosen by a teacher or someone who knows how children learn: these must be "
"the syllables you have to learn just after the alphabet in order to learn "
"well the basics of this language. Please send me a mail if you are able to "
"do that. See <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/klettres/add_language.php\">the "
"&klettres; website</ulink> for detailed instructions on how to add a new "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Da bi dodali novi jezik, potreban mi je zvuk za alfabet i neki osnovni "
"slogani. Neko govoreći nativno novi jezik mora snimiti ove zvukove u ogg "
"formatu. Za levele 3 i 4, slogani moraju biti izabrani od učitelja ili ili "
"od nekog ko zna kako učiti dijete: ovo moraju biti slogani koji se uče odmah "
"poslije alfabeta u smislu dobrog učenja osnova jezika. Molim vas pošaljite "
"mi mail ako ste u mogućnosti da uradite to. . Pogledajte  <ulink url="
"\"http://edu.kde.org/klettres/add_language.php\">the &klettres; website</"
"ulink>za detaljnjije instrukcije kako dodati novi jezik."

